# claude: this fork never had a .gitignore at all - build outputs (kernel
# ELF/asm listing, mkfs, initcode, the linked user _binaries, fs.img)
# were untracked but cluttering `git status` after every build. None of
# these are checked-in source; unlike forks/rpi1's source/fs.img or
# forks/loongarch's ramdisk.h, this port's Makefile builds fs.img fresh
# from mkfs + UPROGS every time, so nothing here needs to be tracked.
# (per-program *.asm disassembly listings are covered by the toplevel
# .gitignore's *.asm)
kernel/kernel
kernel/*.sym
mkfs/mkfs
fs.img
user/*.sym
user/initcode
user/initcode.out
user/usys.S
user/_*
